            <div xml:id="d868">

                <pb facs="0854" n="688" xml:id="pg688"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 711.5914/177</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Copenhagen</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-12-20T18:00:00+01:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 20, 1916, 6 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>401. In the Lower House today 90 voted for ratification of the treaty, 16 against
                    it and 5 members were absent.</p>
                <p>The vote will be taken in the Upper House tomorrow.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Egan</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
